      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It’s a very heavy realization to come to, and it’s completely understandable that you feel this way right now. That feeling of falling short of an imagined standard is a deep and painful kind of disappointment. Instead of viewing your \"average\" as a failure, perhaps see it as a solid, reliable foundation for something else entirely. There is immense power in simply existing and being present in the world.",
